      <h2 id="multi-arch-tuning-operator-release-notes-1-3-3_multi-arch-tuning-operator-release-notes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Release notes for the Multiarch Tuning Operator 1.3.3<a href="#multi-arch-tuning-operator-release-notes-1-3-3_multi-arch-tuning-operator-release-notes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
